{
  "$comment": [
    "Which faces the hyperlegible typography profile is set in, and exactly which bytes.",
    "",
    "The version is pinned exactly in package.json and the tarball is checksummed by",
    "package-lock.json's `integrity`, so npm already guarantees the archive. What this file adds",
    "is a guarantee about the *eight files cuecraft actually draws with*: their names, their",
    "sizes and their SHA-256. A package whose contents changed under an unchanged version, a",
    "half-extracted node_modules, or a weight quietly dropped upstream are all things the",
    "tarball hash cannot tell you about after the fact, and all things `npm run bootstrap:fonts`",
    "reports by name.",
    "",
    "Only the weights the deck sets (400, 500, 600, 700), latin only, upright only. Both",
    "families ship OFL-1.1 in `license` below.",
    "",
    "See archaeology/sprints/0029-*/ and archaeology/dragons/0004-*.md."
  ],
